<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Firestorm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 28, up to 80%)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast firestorm &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast firestorm</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Maelstra incerinata!' and points, and flaming droplets 
rain down around the target. The better your magic and your skill in the 
spell, the more it burns. Cast with great power, it does a little better 
against clothes and light leather than against heavier armour; a weak one 
does a little less against clothes. A shield softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
